    "https://careers.werecruit.io/en/escp-business-school": {
      "title": "Welcome on our recruitment website",
      "description": "Recruitment space ESCP Business School | All jobs available With your agreement, We Recruit and our partners use cookies or similar technologies to store, access, and process personal data like your visit on this website, IP addresses and cookie identifiers. Some partners do not ask for your consent to process your data and rely on their legitimate business interest. You can withdraw your consent or object to data processing based on legitimate interest at any time by clicking on “Learn More” or in our Privacy Policy on this website. View our 8 partners Learn More → Disagree and close Agree and close Menu Company page Espace Carrière & Mobilité des salariés ESCP Plus Recrutement en Europe Site ESCP See our jobs EN EN FR Company page Espace Carrière & Mobilité des salariés ESCP Recrutement en Europe Site ESCP EN Retour EN EN FR See our jobs Welcome on our recruitment website See jobs Spontaneous application Who are we ? Founded in 1819, ESCP is a management school that teaches its students responsible leadership, based on European multiculturalism and open to the world, from its integrated campuses in Berlin, London, Madrid, Paris, Turin, and Warsaw. Our students are trained in the belief that the business world can positively enrich society and are driven by the values ​​of excellence, individuality, creativity, and plurality that guide the school's educational vision every day. Each year, ESCP welcomes more than 10,000 students and 6,000 executives from 130 different nationalities. Its strength lies in its numerous general and specialized management training programs: Bachelor's, Master's, MBA, Executive MBA, Doctorate-PhD, and continuing education, all of which incorporate a multi-campus experience. ESCP Business School is committed to diversity and equal opportunity. We value the skills and talents of all students, regardless of origin, gender, age, disability, or other legally protected characteristics. In accordance with our inclusion policy, our positions are open to everyone, including people with disabilities. If you require specific accommodations during the recruitment process or for the position, please do not hesitate to let us know. Jobs Offers Filters Reset × Departments Administratif (1) Career Center (1) Communication (3) Décanat (1) Executive education (1) Executive Education - Formation Continue (3) Executive Management (1) Finance (2) Informatique (1) Programmes - Formation Initiale (4) Ranking (1) School of technology (2) Student Experience (1) No filter Place 75 - Paris (20) 92 - Levallois-Perret (1) NW - London (1) No filter Contract type Temporary contract (9) Apprenticeship (2) Internship (2) Permanent contract (9) No filter Employment type Full time (21) Part time (1) No filter Apply filters 22 Jobs found Job found Filters Chargé, chargée de scolarité M2 F/H Temporary contract - 6 months Full time Paris Je postule Program officer – Apprenticeship F/H Apprenticeship - 12 months Full time Paris Je postule Communications Intern (3–6 months) F/H Internship - 6 months Full time Paris Je postule European Financial Controller – Degree Programmes Business Unit F/H Permanent contract Full time Levallois-Perret Je postule European Financial Controller – Infrastructure & Campus Life F/H Permanent contract Full time Paris Je postule Student Societies Coordinator F/H Permanent contract Full time Paris Je postule Voir plus d'offres Would you like to send a spontaneous application? Spontaneous application Follow us Follow us Jobs Spontaneous application Useful links Terms of Use Cookies Website map Recruiters access Consent choices Powered by Applicant Tracking System"
